title: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=actions
intro: Dismissing one card or every included card, why the dialog asks for a reason, what it warns about when a card gates 'Send to payer', and how to bring a card back.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the toast says the reason 'feeds Analytics', but no Analytics screen reads it. The reason shows in 'Logged decisions', on the dismissed card and in the Dashboard request's history.
---
click d1 "Click 'Dismiss' on one card"
click d2 "Click 'Dismiss recommendations' in the side panel\n(all included cards at once)"
overlay m "Dialog 'Dismiss this recommendation?' or 'Dismiss 3 recommendations?'\n'Say why. The reason is logged and helps the agents learn what is useful.'"
process li "Bullet list of the card titles"
decision dg "Does a title clear a check that gates 'Send to payer'?"
toast wb "Warning: '... clears a check that gates Send to payer. Dismissing it leaves that check open. You can bring it back later.'"

group gR "Reason (pick one)"
  click r1 "Pick 'Already handled outside Psyflo'"
  click r2 "Pick 'Not relevant to this request'"
  click r3 "Pick 'The chart does not support it'"
  click r4 "Pick 'Other'"
endgroup
input ot "Type in 'Tell us in a few words'"
decision dok "Is a reason picked, and text typed if it is 'Other'?"
process dis "'Dismiss and log' stays off"
click cf "Click 'Dismiss and log'"
click cx "Click 'Cancel', the X or the dimmed area, or press Esc"
endx ce "Dialog closes\nNothing changes"

store st "Each card saved as dismissed with the reason and the time\nLog: You dismissed '(title)'. Reason: ..."
store dsh "If the request is on the Dashboard: an event on its history\n'You dismissed ... Reason: ...'"
toast tt "'Recommendation dismissed' or '3 recommendations dismissed'\n'The reason is logged and feeds Analytics.'"
process mv "Cards leave the open list\nHeader line 'up to N%' drops their points\n'Dismissed (1)' appears: struck-through title, 'Reason logged: ...'"
process gt "If the card gated a check, that check stays open\n'Send to payer' stays off"

click bb "Click 'Bring back' on a dismissed card"
store rs "Card returns to the open list\nLog: 'You brought back a dismissed recommendation'"
process nt "No toast; the points count again"

d1 --> m
d2 --> m
m --> li --> dg
dg -->|Yes| wb
dg -->|No| r1
wb --> r1
m --> r1 & r2 & r3 & r4
r4 --> ot
r1 --> dok
r2 --> dok
r3 --> dok
ot --> dok
dok -->|No| dis
dok -->|Yes| cf
m --> cx --> ce
cf --> st --> dsh
st --> tt
st --> mv --> gt
mv --> bb --> rs --> nt
